		<data>
			<say>
				<who>FR_CROSSBOW</who>
				<text>Teller: Who are you? What are you doing here?</text>
			</say>
			<say>
				<who>FR_BLACKMAGE</who>
				<text>Drake: I am the Wizard of the Black Magic order. Me and my friends tried to reach our brothers, but we were intercepted by these... creatures. My friend didn't survive.</text>
			</say>
			<say>
				<who>FR_SWORDMASTER</who>
				<text>Taggart: You have burried him right here? Soon you will meet him.</text>
			</say>
			<say>
				<who>FR_BLACKMAGE</who>
				<text>Drake: I dematerialized his body. But this makes no sense. Blood attracts more creatures. They will appear soon enough, and I see that you are alone here.</text>
			</say>
			<say>
				<who>FR_SWORDMASTER</who>
				<text>Taggart: We are scouting the way. The rest are only five minutes behind. We'll wait here.</text>
			</say>
